WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.600
SCP-682 VS SCP-507. The Hard to Destroy&nbsp;
Reptile vs the reluctant dimension hopper.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.800
Could this unlikely hero finally be the one who&nbsp;
gets rid of this cantankerous, unkillable beast?

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.760
SCP-682 was heavily injured to the point of being&nbsp;
immobilized, and SCP-507 was tied to its leg,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.640
in hopes of teleporting it away. Eventually,&nbsp;
both creatures blipped out of existence.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:30.640
63 hours later, 507 returned, tied to a&nbsp;
creature with large fangs and vestigial wings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:37.200
but was otherwise identical to SCP-682. 507&nbsp;
had a note attached to his chest, reading:

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:43.760
“Dear Universe 5802-Sigma-Blue-Romeo;
It's your problem now, suckers.”

